{"en": "1530953742", "title": "Configuration des unités de laboratoire dans OpenELIS : gestion des services du laboratoire et des dépendances des analyses", "adf": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 1, "localId": "a928a0e3aa86"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Configuration des unités de laboratoire"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "f7e98be5a18f"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Dépôt :", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " "}, {"type": "text", "text": "DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://github.com/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", branche "}, {"type": "text", "text": "madagascar", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "2405d8302bfa"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Les unités de laboratoire ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "TestSection", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", par exemple Hématologie, Biochimie, Sérologie) représentent les services ou paillasses du laboratoire. Ce sont des "}, {"type": "text", "text": "entités de base", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " du "}, {"type": "text", "text": "système de configuration des données de domaine", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://claude.ai/chat/Configuration-System-Overview.md"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " d'OpenELIS : le domaine "}, {"type": "text", "text": "tests", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (ordre de chargement 200) exige que chaque analyse fasse référence à une unité de laboratoire existante ; les unités de laboratoire doivent donc exister en premier."}]}, {"type": "table", "attrs": {"layout": "default", "width": 760.0, "localId": "d8a426aa-8c57-414d-9b8f-3c267b117f3a"}, "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "b1a68279-036b-4ca4-830a-9c51e2e4bdab"}, "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "c5ff1483-732b-4942-9b9d-31621350f0f0"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "7e777d13dc2a"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Domaine"}]}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "37dfa4da-12b1-453e-8bc8-2ad36e12fe09"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "533e406de4ca"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Objectif"}]}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "08cf7378-8750-4f38-a7c7-fe8e38446990"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "7b9cd2e14da2"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ordre de chargement"}]}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "8f077bcf-9d0f-4d11-8496-c249a60ef15b"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "71247af20c3d"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Gestionnaire (handler)"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "3cf83629-5729-4741-a677-e11da7755b49"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "58fbc771-0beb-44bd-a17f-4535259bac18"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "f47603610dc5"}, "content": [{"text": "test-sections", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "368ad878-a22d-47b8-8836-a97bc83760b7"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "b90c74b7bb3c"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Définit les services ou paillasses du laboratoire"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "509c8f14-4112-41e6-bd09-de10255a1d57"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "2c93d9fd9936"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "100 (chargé en premier, avec "}, {"type": "text", "text": "sample-types", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ")"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "292bb25d-e9fd-4896-9e52-76c5febbb550"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "dae937083c38"}, "content": [{"text": "TestSectionConfigurationHandler", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "c111b6d9-5413-4db9-8a12-31e1e55fcca4"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "351d19dc-ed60-46c6-bcec-b627957f2ef7"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "29bb294f4d74"}, "content": [{"text": "tests", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "3fff8b3d-1449-4499-81c9-a12f00b6c70c"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "20617f700bd0"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Définit les analyses, chacune rattachée à une unité de laboratoire"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "75304f3e-e476-414a-b2e4-5fa532936617"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "dccd4505e1d3"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "200 (dépend de ce domaine)"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "971d11d8-e67a-4423-bb22-2dd2cdd1a947"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "2fc0f5306181"}, "content": [{"text": "TestConfigurationHandler", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "a8b0d9064eb0"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Comme pour les types d'échantillon, il n'existe pas encore de documentation Markdown dédiée à ce domaine dans "}, {"type": "text", "text": "docs/configuration/", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". La présente page a été rédigée à partir du code source du gestionnaire ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "TestSectionConfigurationHandler.java", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") et du CSV d'exemple fourni, dans le même style que la documentation existante pour les rôles, les dictionnaires et les questionnaires."}]}, {"type": "rule", "attrs": {"localId": "e3da2365-54c2-4f78-9b43-cc420750a939"}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "f0d3816bee82"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Emplacement des fichiers"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "attrs": {"localId": "fb402ade-1089-4acc-98f1-3e5fa42f8481"}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "777e32c8-e5c0-430c-af23-941b96b3a020"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "876568cc8d2d"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Classpath (intégré au build) :", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " "}, {"type": "text", "text": "src/main/resources/configuration/test-sections/*.csv", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "82220e50-e8cd-42b8-afff-a6a4eb04ace2"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "8e1e6cf624ac"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Système de fichiers (à l'exécution, monté par Docker) :", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " "}, {"type": "text", "text": "/var/lib/openelis-global/configuration/backend/test-sections/*.csv", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", associé à "}, {"type": "text", "text": "./configuration/backend/test-sections/", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " sur l'hôte via le montage de volume défini dans "}, {"type": "text", "text": "docker-compose.yml", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "6e54f7ab-42fe-4224-b383-437c854f637d"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "5c26f42c02db"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Exemple (non chargé automatiquement) :", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " "}, {"type": "text", "text": "volume/configuration/backend/test-sections/example-test-sections.csv", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "a3d007e5cb5b"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Format CSV"}]}, {"type": "codeBlock", "attrs": {"localId": "c1071547-e7c4-4851-9c7e-0b6d292b473b", "wrap": true}, "marks": [{"type": "breakout", "attrs": {"mode": "wide", "width": 760}}], "content": [{"text": "testSectionName,description,isActive,sortOrder,isExternal,englishName,frenchName\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "table", "attrs": {"layout": "default", "width": 760.0, "localId": "84ff6f4a-7b26-4183-844f-c281b93985c0"}, "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "aa7e6508-9da0-4048-b43f-7b23af4640c8"}, "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "1ab152c3-d2f9-43ec-8b0c-e13f541587bf"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "1e4d515e3f68"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Colonne"}]}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "a9c61d6a-8cb5-4b55-b53a-1a62cfd2af3c"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "454807db2d71"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Obligatoire ?"}]}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "4c9a244c-b381-4c29-8f21-3fb6f57594b5"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "4fa8ce776210"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Valeur par défaut si vide"}]}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "d13755e4-6761-45de-ba05-08c2b9e6af49"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "524828029ddc"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Remarques"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "96ed6c44-f68a-4de6-b07c-fd3e0455e65d"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "5a52f2e2-6f4d-4b01-a18f-2c407e7037db"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "5ccc5fcc76b6"}, "content": [{"text": "testSectionName", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "44131c2c-559c-4590-9161-cae0fc74a3a8"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "df11c69758f8"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Oui", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "e209664c-a7c7-4fa9-a072-7922db11c84c"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "4945e1887961"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Aucune : la ligne est ignorée avec un avertissement si la valeur manque ; le fichier entier est rejeté si la colonne elle-même est absente de l'en-tête"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "7c41b16c-4db5-4e87-a792-cd091e7b475d"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "cec20de79a12"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Nom unique de l'unité (par exemple « Hematology »). Seule clé de recherche utilisée pour décider entre mise à jour et création."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "3fda7ab5-6f50-46c8-86e6-2ea4e66d6c23"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "d6b48df7-2a02-47b7-9a00-fc0ccffc3ee9"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "65e3a7c485e0"}, "content": [{"text": "description", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "7defbe6f-b28b-4110-b10d-9192a15d4b63"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "4b421dd6737f"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Non"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "105685f5-8d97-46ec-b2e8-d55767b03ba0"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "f12ef08771ab"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Reprend "}, {"type": "text", "text": "testSectionName", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "701f5080-d06c-4679-a2a4-569a0fcc1559"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "03a6e9bba640"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Description libre du service."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "d99dd76b-fc70-463e-8a82-24f949fb683a"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "936b629e-f69d-4826-bfd6-e04b26f5a669"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "dbdffa2f86d3"}, "content": [{"text": "isActive", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "3271fe76-386e-4066-8724-474cc6749a5d"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "60d2f73ffbb5"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Non"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "0827b525-b585-413d-b175-71fa869d0d28"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "b90a202c06ef"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Y", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (actif) à la création ; inchangé lors d'une mise à jour si vide"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "e00ea970-5804-4492-be7f-c1a81916c415"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "84c865c56cd1"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Accepte "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Y", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "/"}, {"type": "text", "text": "true", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (sans distinction de casse) pour « actif » ; toute autre valeur est normalisée en "}, {"type": "text", "text": "N", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "cf4e5e3c-9a0e-48af-ba7d-4f86af5cb9fc"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "353f16f1-4a1a-4bef-a240-34125fb9f2d7"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "2daedf266fe9"}, "content": [{"text": "sortOrder", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "024418f5-739f-470d-bf52-4fa990f4ba86"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "22bf8fb94b28"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Non"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "d0a1449c-0af7-4929-b3f1-22272ea8e3a3"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "f844a64f580a"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Attribué automatiquement : "}, {"type": "text", "text": "(current max sortOrder across all existing test sections) + 1", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", incrémenté à chaque ligne du fichier"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "0a2da739-0e42-41cd-a8d5-f658ccffddf4"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "d61b8cb91b9e"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Doit être un entier s'il est fourni ; les valeurs invalides sont journalisées et, à la création, remplacées par la valeur attribuée automatiquement (lors d'une mise à jour, la valeur existante reste simplement inchangée)."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "6b15b9dd-a4df-4c56-8f52-228987683bed"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "4b564ba7-c188-43a4-99d5-fc32eeab20e7"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "52d325884538"}, "content": [{"text": "isExternal", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "bf3b42d1-92b8-446d-a2e5-5f91d710cb72"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "c032d6eaf89a"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Non"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "246d94f8-2a98-45f4-b135-ed5d44724004"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "72db89003be3"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "N", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " à la création ; inchangé lors d'une mise à jour si vide"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "6f6a3fcf-de36-4b2a-b8b3-25caf0eb1e72"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "3df905c4d826"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Indique que l'unité est réalisée à l'extérieur, dans un laboratoire de référence. Visible dans l'interface d'administration (Test Section Menu), mais le chargeur CSV ne permet pas de définir la structure de référence associée, champ "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Organisation", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "organization", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") : elle doit toujours être définie depuis l'interface."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "33484bc3-9458-4393-adab-b942fc3ec75b"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "c318df2f-667f-40d4-8282-b19bda5d9ee9"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "20574acdb94f"}, "content": [{"text": "englishName", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "9f9ab090-553b-4644-b27b-a48680cfd81e"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "74b4ce81b95f"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Non"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "876cb528-4c33-4848-a79a-788991952dd1"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "c8669bd28ed6"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Reprend "}, {"type": "text", "text": "testSectionName", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "1c3dba15-3d4a-49e8-a674-1b62abb7eb1b"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "598d2c1ee7a3"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sert à créer ou mettre à jour l'entrée "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Localization", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " de l'unité (anglais)."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "44fd79d2-088f-41bf-af20-b7f2fc098a1c"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "b23785e5-d89b-466c-b6d1-160ea762e298"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "2507ea50ebcf"}, "content": [{"text": "frenchName", "type": "text", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "e4a152a8-3378-4881-b75a-55afa23599cd"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "8e45fa35ef94"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Non"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "e20873b5-1cc9-45b8-8371-3bfd6398f0eb"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "1ca497f3c8a7"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Reprend "}, {"type": "text", "text": "englishName", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "552c2a68-8a04-4d82-9f19-0928b5053580"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "cff5b5b63c19"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sert à créer ou mettre à jour l'entrée "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Localization", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " de l'unité (français)."}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "c87d91ede127"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Seule la colonne "}, {"type": "text", "text": "testSectionName", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " est strictement obligatoire dans la ligne d'en-tête."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "f4fef1b16ba3"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Exemple de fichier"}]}, {"type": "codeBlock", "attrs": {"localId": "54d1a331-ece7-4207-b17f-481775c2520c", "wrap": true}, "marks": [{"type": "breakout", "attrs": {"mode": "wide", "width": 760}}], "content": [{"text": "testSectionName,description,isActive,sortOrder,isExternal,englishName,frenchName\nHematology,Hematology Department,Y,1,N,Hematology,Hématologie\nBiochemistry,Biochemistry Department,Y,2,N,Biochemistry,Biochimie\nSerology,Serology Department,Y,3,N,Serology,Sérologie\nParasitology,Parasitology Department,Y,4,N,Parasitology,Parasitologie\nUrinalysis,Urinalysis Department,Y,5,N,Urinalysis,Analyse Urinaire\nMicrobiology,Microbiology Department,Y,6,N,Microbiology,Microbiologie\nImmunology,Immunology Department,Y,7,N,Immunology,Immunologie\nMolecular Biology,Molecular Biology Department,Y,8,N,Molecular Biology,Biologie Moléculaire\nCytology,Cytology Department,Y,9,N,Cytology,Cytologie\nHistopathology,Histopathology Department,Y,10,N,Histopathology,Histopathologie\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "0f67298088b4"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "(Il s'agit du fichier "}, {"type": "text", "text": "example-test-sections.csv", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " fourni : copiez-le dans "}, {"type": "text", "text": "configuration/backend/test-sections/", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " et renommez-le, par exemple "}, {"type": "text", "text": "madagascar-test-sections.csv", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", pour qu'il soit chargé. Les fichiers placés dans un sous-dossier "}, {"type": "text", "text": "examples/", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ne sont jamais chargés automatiquement.)"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "b2fe74673902"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Fonctionnement de la correspondance (création ou mise à jour)"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "ce4d1711b94d"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pour chaque ligne de données :"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "2b2b6523-46c8-47cd-9772-6189197e8392", "order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "f8381db9-0f53-454c-806b-bf3624b63019"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "a8921d484ec6"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Recherche d'une unité de laboratoire existante par "}, {"type": "text", "text": "testSectionName", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (correspondance exacte, via "}, {"type": "text", "text": "testSectionService.getTestSectionByName()", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ")."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "55aac3c8-6ee6-462b-9b98-f83fa781978b"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "d0276eabc22a"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Si elle est trouvée → mise à jour de sa description (si fournie), de l'indicateur actif (si fourni), de l'ordre de tri (si fourni), de l'indicateur externe (si fourni) et de la localisation anglaise/française (si fournie). Les champs laissés vides dans le CSV restent simplement inchangés dans l'enregistrement existant."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "1474c447-ea9f-44dd-9f13-0ce8b1a0d2a3"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "a3fd27a9d76a"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Si elle n'est pas trouvée → création d'une nouvelle "}, {"type": "text", "text": "TestSection", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " et de l'enregistrement "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Localization", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " correspondant, puis insertion avec l'indicateur actif, l'ordre de tri et l'indicateur externe déterminés."}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "264b7c0d8575"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ainsi, réexécuter le même fichier est idempotent au niveau de la ligne : tant que "}, {"type": "text", "text": "testSectionName", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " reste stable, les chargements suivants mettent à jour au lieu de créer des doublons."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "9c9961701423"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Champs que le chargeur CSV ne couvre "}, {"type": "text", "text": "pas", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "cc021ba235f6"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "TestSection", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " possède deux champs supplémentaires, visibles dans l'interface d'administration, qui ne peuvent "}, {"type": "text", "text": "pas", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " être définis par ce mécanisme de configuration :"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "attrs": {"localId": "60e2c7a6-f234-435e-bf11-1016deddc9f1"}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "a6e5bf8f-f7be-42a3-8b28-b09664e408cd"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "14e70de947b3"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "organization", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " : la structure de référence associée à une unité de laboratoire externe"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "2ea8f46d-0188-498e-84df-b29a7b2b225b"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "6aa72f3d7423"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "parentTestSection", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " : une hiérarchie parent/enfant entre unités"}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "f6df62a2f2c0"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Si un déploiement à Madagascar a besoin de l'un ou l'autre, il faut toujours les configurer manuellement dans la page d'administration Test Section après le chargement par CSV."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "4a23490575b0"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Détails d'analyse syntaxique à connaître"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "attrs": {"localId": "dbb24812-9446-4de5-9193-731fb8ae66ff"}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "43a36013-4da8-4772-a5ad-595d54224842"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "1582ae378b93"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "L'analyseur CSV est la même petite implémentation artisanale que celle des autres gestionnaires de domaine basés sur CSV : il prend en charge les champs entre guillemets doubles (les valeurs contenant des virgules doivent être entre guillemets), mais "}, {"type": "text", "text": "pas", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " les guillemets échappés à l'intérieur d'un champ entre guillemets."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "0ca4a43a-d06f-4f88-a606-ad339c43ea76"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "7aa48b0fc0d3"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "L'ordre des colonnes dans l'en-tête n'a pas d'importance : les colonnes sont repérées par leur nom (sans distinction de casse), et non par leur position."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "aaa4cbf0-e519-4f5f-bf20-240fe3d73201"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "ccfb1a8aef5c"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Les lignes vides sont ignorées."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "672f33e0-bb56-4760-868d-7ba69c541475"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "709e1b2a5e47"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Toute exception au niveau d'une ligne est journalisée et la ligne est ignorée ; le traitement du reste du fichier n'est pas interrompu."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "f1438195-54b9-4b83-a680-80399266bb63"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "2a5ed4fe45cd"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Après le traitement, le chargeur appelle "}, {"type": "text", "text": "testSectionService.refreshNames()", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " et "}, {"type": "text", "text": "DisplayListService.refreshLists()", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " : les unités nouvelles ou modifiées apparaissent donc immédiatement dans les listes déroulantes (y compris la colonne "}, {"type": "text", "text": "testSection", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " du chargeur CSV "}, {"type": "text", "text": "tests", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "), sans redémarrage."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "e1175a1a9ddc"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Dépendance des domaines en aval"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "bbbbb0b754cb"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Comme "}, {"type": "text", "text": "test-sections", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " est chargé à l'ordre 100 (avant "}, {"type": "text", "text": "tests", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " à l'ordre 200), une unité de laboratoire citée par son nom dans un fichier "}, {"type": "text", "text": "tests/*.csv", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " doit :"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "attrs": {"localId": "76ef60a4-f874-4755-87b9-9cc89fe1743f"}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "58403716-362d-4039-bb2b-6156a1186ee1"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "759ff0172151"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "soit déjà exister dans la base de données à la suite d'un chargement précédent,"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "82b58947-46e8-4a27-baac-dd3d5cb621d4"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "841e7239471e"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "soit être définie dans un fichier "}, {"type": "text", "text": "test-sections/*.csv", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " traité lors du même démarrage (ce qui sera le cas, puisque 100 < 200 garantit l'ordre au cours d'une même exécution)."}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "9e51740ee867"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Si une valeur "}, {"type": "text", "text": "testSection", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " du CSV "}, {"type": "text", "text": "tests", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ne correspond à aucun nom d'unité existant, "}, {"type": "text", "text": "TestConfigurationHandler", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " journalise un avertissement et ignore entièrement la ligne de cette analyse : il ne crée pas l'unité de laboratoire à votre place."}]}, {"type": "rule", "attrs": {"localId": "009cbf29-bf0d-4e2e-b3e7-ff3c7bb72167"}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "767ba15cbc03"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Synthèse pour un déploiement à Madagascar"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "c008a525-fe13-4e3c-8583-83de22cc53b7", "order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "0adb6fb8-1c65-4826-b939-3b0beb906a0b"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "a3953717a4f9"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Copiez "}, {"type": "text", "text": "volume/configuration/backend/test-sections/example-test-sections.csv", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " vers "}, {"type": "text", "text": "configuration/backend/test-sections/madagascar-test-sections.csv", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (côté hôte, monté dans le conteneur) et modifiez-le pour refléter les services réellement utilisés (ajout ou suppression d'unités, ajustement des noms français)."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "4ddc4715-b32c-4c46-97f5-812395e3d0dc"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "8b564a4ff435"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Reprenez exactement ces valeurs "}, {"type": "text", "text": "testSectionName", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " dans la colonne "}, {"type": "text", "text": "testSection", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " de votre fichier "}, {"type": "text", "text": "configuration/backend/tests/*.csv", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "8c48a177-328a-415b-a151-681fbbd71554"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "cf5a5cab0da1"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Redémarrez le conteneur (ou déclenchez autrement "}, {"type": "text", "text": "ContextRefreshedEvent", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "). Le chargeur va :"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "attrs": {"localId": "e1eb07f5-02ca-4af7-a7ee-c07de26b2509"}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "daaaa56d-74b3-44b1-9868-c7238e48acb1"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "31cfeecec9d4"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "détecter le fichier nouveau ou modifié (aucune somme de contrôle enregistrée, ou somme de contrôle différente),"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "7d7aea7a-bde8-47cc-b62d-261198860718"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "2c08f0330c95"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "charger "}, {"type": "text", "text": "test-sections", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " à l'ordre 100,"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "1c33f240-573d-4964-8564-667f3fb076f8"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "9d8948001ed5"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "puis "}, {"type": "text", "text": "tests", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " à l'ordre 200, moment où les unités référencées existent déjà,"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "6f57fec6-5bda-4d60-a95f-c39e5654d9a9"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "b08f5f1dd2fb"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "enregistrer les sommes de contrôle afin que les fichiers inchangés soient ignorés au redémarrage suivant."}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "644f5e67-1362-4c32-8b8a-7a83e3d4b97a"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "57db1163faf7"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Si une unité a besoin d'une structure de référence ou d'une relation avec une unité parente, configurez-la ensuite dans la page d'administration Test Section : cela dépasse le périmètre du chargeur CSV."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "12ea36dff912"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Dépannage rapide"}]}, {"type": "table", "attrs": {"layout": "default", "width": 760.0, "localId": "6094192a-5e00-4fd4-9fbe-da1f6cb9aec4"}, "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "06502718-dfec-4550-af13-0d10cb321fdd"}, "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "9809598b-3c62-4ff4-b0f8-01df65a64c00"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "57832d09b0bf"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Symptôme"}]}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "67197e86-574c-47af-9984-cd4db2b4142c"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "aa07483e16f5"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cause probable"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "f77f8319-c80a-4943-9bfb-472802dbc313"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "996b2671-80b6-4d18-bd74-dad5f609480c"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "94342c952820"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "L'unité de laboratoire n'apparaît pas dans les listes déroulantes après le redémarrage"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "29ce6987-bfcc-4ebc-9c12-e4ac42da580b"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "35429dc4496f"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Fichier absent de "}, {"type": "text", "text": "configuration/backend/test-sections/", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (vérifiez qu'il ne se trouve pas dans un sous-dossier "}, {"type": "text", "text": "examples/", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "), ou colonne "}, {"type": "text", "text": "testSectionName", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " absente ou mal orthographiée dans l'en-tête"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "3532171e-682a-4961-a31d-4bd20f221312"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "239bd414-1e86-4561-8047-99020afe44a4"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "a934699160d4"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Une analyse ne se charge pas, avec le message « Test section not found »"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "27376d87-23ad-4263-9de5-36d14ffd422c"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "6c16ef006867"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "La valeur "}, {"type": "text", "text": "testSection", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " de "}, {"type": "text", "text": "tests/*.csv", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ne correspond pas exactement à un "}, {"type": "text", "text": "testSectionName", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " existant (sans distinction de casse, mais exact par ailleurs)"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "e86905df-f022-444e-a467-8d8f14bcd390"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "75237b44-5281-41e9-bf2c-0e063ffb6f77"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "9ed4ae67cf19"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ordre de tri différent de celui attendu"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "17da05d9-79fe-4495-9f18-71b34ad83447"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "94a3b357403d"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "sortOrder", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " laissé vide : l'attribution automatique se base sur le maximum actuel parmi "}, {"type": "text", "text": "toutes", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " les unités de laboratoire, incrémenté à chaque ligne ; les fichiers ajoutés tardivement se placent donc à la fin, quel que soit l'ordre interne du fichier"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "16ba9d1a-8c51-4646-9a5a-c11c6e7ee7af"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "eff9b639-faa5-4946-a634-f220b667fe0d"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "55a66039c1c4"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Indicateur "}, {"type": "text", "text": "isExternal", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ou lien vers la structure mal affiché"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "5f15ff93-dcb8-4378-98c3-8e4f70364a06"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "4d1ae8e5ea14"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Le chargeur CSV définit uniquement l'indicateur "}, {"type": "text", "text": "isExternal", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", et non la structure associée : celle-ci doit être reliée manuellement dans l'interface d'administration"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "ef6bbd4e-848f-40c8-ba43-2fdba98ecc8f"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "c31d0148-4a82-412a-aade-b3d27df014c9"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "60cba2b59f92"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Le même fichier est retraité à chaque redémarrage"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "c2833695-8d59-4a17-8804-56988299d583"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "471b6e9be053"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cela ne se produit que si le contenu du fichier a réellement changé (somme de contrôle différente) ; vérifiez si des fichiers régénérés présentent des espaces ou des fins de ligne différents d'un build à l'autre"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "5902d77d60ad"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pour aller plus loin"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "attrs": {"localId": "31e143e2-6be5-46c6-a379-9bd7a253458f"}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "2c1005af-5e2a-40c6-be93-68ede2b110a7"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "9d39ec43ee27"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Configuration-System-Overview", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " : le fonctionnement général du chargeur de configuration par domaine piloté par somme de contrôle, et sa relation avec la configuration de déploiement et les paramètres "}, {"type": "text", "text": "SiteInformation", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " à l'exécution."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "624f6c4e-9f4f-44d1-b51f-64796952da3f"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "7032275481cf"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Sample-Types-Configuration", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " : le domaine d'entités de base voisin (également à l'ordre de chargement 100), dont les analyses dépendent aussi."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "4f64b5f0-787d-4ff6-b92a-449cbca68a10"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "2f3dc6bdad3b"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "docs/configuration/README.md", "marks": [{"type": "code"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " : l'index de la documentation de configuration du projet."}]}]}]}], "version": 1}}